; Second step to find Z probe offset

G31 P500 X25 Y0 ; Set the probe X and Y offsets in active memory
G92 Z0.2        ; Set current position to Z=0
G1 Z10          ; Lift head 10mm
G30 S-3 F20     ; Probe bed, calculate trigger height, and update Z offset in memory
M500 P31        ; Save the new G31 Z offset to config-override.g